    "name": "Rine: The Trail of Fireflies",
    "steam_appid": 2986700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<table><tr><td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/aaf9650b062c170fefaa264c8c346927.avif?t=1746088116\" width=293 height=312 /></span></td><td> Sit down my friend, and i shall tell you the fable of this game.<br><br>A fable about courage, light and darkness! <br>A fable about wasps and fireflies...<br>And nonetheless... A fable about a little blue fox called Rine and how he bravely bought back the light to the world!<br><br>How did the light went missing?   <br>He he\u2026 We shall let the story tell... </td></tr></table><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rine woke up after a deep slumber only to find out that all the light went missing in all the Seven Forests! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so, he went on a journey to bring back the light!\u00a0A journey filled with adventure... and dangerous! The darkness fell on to the world, leaving all the animals in a crazy state. They will attack everyone that gets near them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > But worry not! The trustworthy fireflies, the only source of light that remained, are a resourceful bunch! They will help Rine along the way and guide him to the sparkling light at the end of the tunnel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now go my friend! Play this game along Rine and the fireflies and unveil the mystery of the missing light!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>GAME MECHANICS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each firefly has a color. Gather up to three fireflies and combine their colors in order to activate the flowers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/11c5e53e13f953d8eba4d786044db175.poster.avif?t=1746088116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/11c5e53e13f953d8eba4d786044db175.webm?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/11c5e53e13f953d8eba4d786044db175.mp4?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massively open world</strong> \u2014 Discover a big open world full of stories, puzzles and hidden quests that will keep you immersed into the game. Play as you like and go where you please!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/d69fa9386539038cdf38209a5b5fd08d.avif?t=1746088116\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Funny and intriguing interactions</strong> \u2014 The fireflies are resourceful, helpful and funny. Each one of them has their own story! Discover each one of them and do their quests\u2026 and you shall be rewarded with a great achievement!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/b535943ae013677df99e0419bab69683.poster.avif?t=1746088116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/b535943ae013677df99e0419bab69683.webm?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/b535943ae013677df99e0419bab69683.mp4?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diversity</strong> \u2014 A variety of enemies to run from, and plants to interact with! Use the fireflies collected along the way to interact with the plants and to open a path for you!</p></li></ul><table><tr><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/5f26f02e1c63af647eef8e5383f26e41.poster.avif?t=1746088116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/5f26f02e1c63af647eef8e5383f26e41.webm?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/5f26f02e1c63af647eef8e5383f26e41.mp4?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/84239519ce0c47cf56ac1ea98d88e632.poster.avif?t=1746088116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/84239519ce0c47cf56ac1ea98d88e632.webm?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/84239519ce0c47cf56ac1ea98d88e632.mp4?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/947ca488103f48b1e487547e72853ab3.poster.avif?t=1746088116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/947ca488103f48b1e487547e72853ab3.webm?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/947ca488103f48b1e487547e72853ab3.mp4?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></td><td><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/9d0d55919740d11450e267bb19bf968d.poster.avif?t=1746088116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/9d0d55919740d11450e267bb19bf968d.webm?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/9d0d55919740d11450e267bb19bf968d.mp4?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></td></tr></table><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong> \u2014 Solve the tricky puzzle of each boss and defeat it in order to free the Seven Forests of their terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/5fa87c7c0498857e0930cbbe696a2484.poster.avif?t=1746088116\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/5fa87c7c0498857e0930cbbe696a2484.webm?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986700/extras/5fa87c7c0498857e0930cbbe696a2484.mp4?t=1746088116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
